{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-blog-post-js","path":"/009-paper-towel-holder/","result":{"data":{"site":{"siteMetadata":{"title":"Wood Times"}},"markdownRemark":{"id":"2b9c7766-6857-585f-a6a0-0497d1962e87","excerpt":"Sometimes the smallest projects bring the most satisfaction. Paper towels are essential in any shop - cleaning up finishes, wiping down tools, the occasional…","html":"<p>Sometimes the smallest projects bring the most satisfaction. Paper towels are essential in any shop - cleaning up finishes, wiping down tools, the occasional spill.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/28ac3eaf6bbf32bcbca125f953b37a0a/669cd/construction.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 133.54430379746836%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"Construction\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/28ac3eaf6bbf32bcbca125f953b37a0a/f058b/construction.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/28ac3eaf6bbf32bcbca125f953b37a0a/c26ae/construction.png 158w,\n/static/28ac3eaf6bbf32bcbca125f953b37a0a/6bdcf/construction.png 315w,\n/static/28ac3eaf6bbf32bcbca125f953b37a0a/f058b/construction.png 630w,\n/static/28ac3eaf6bbf32bcbca125f953b37a0a/40601/construction.png 945w,\n/static/28ac3eaf6bbf32bcbca125f953b37a0a/78612/construction.png 1260w,\n/static/28ac3eaf6bbf32bcbca125f953b37a0a/669cd/construction.png 3024w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>The design was simple: two circular plywood ends connected by a backboard, with a dowel rod to hold the roll. I cut the circles on the bandsaw and smoothed them on the disc sander.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/92c414f600fc2242706232b1155ea157/493ac/mounted_side.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 75.31645569620254%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"Mounted Side\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/92c414f600fc2242706232b1155ea157/f058b/mounted_side.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/92c414f600fc2242706232b1155ea157/c26ae/mounted_side.png 158w,\n/static/92c414f600fc2242706232b1155ea157/6bdcf/mounted_side.png 315w,\n/static/92c414f600fc2242706232b1155ea157/f058b/mounted_side.png 630w,\n/static/92c414f600fc2242706232b1155ea157/40601/mounted_side.png 945w,\n/static/92c414f600fc2242706232b1155ea157/78612/mounted_side.png 1260w,\n/static/92c414f600fc2242706232b1155ea157/493ac/mounted_side.png 4032w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>The open design made swapping rolls easy - just slide the old cardboard tube off and the new roll on.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/4d063d7c53c3a13220718dbda8e2142d/493ac/mounted_front.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 75.31645569620254%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"Mounted Front\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/4d063d7c53c3a13220718dbda8e2142d/f058b/mounted_front.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/4d063d7c53c3a13220718dbda8e2142d/c26ae/mounted_front.png 158w,\n/static/4d063d7c53c3a13220718dbda8e2142d/6bdcf/mounted_front.png 315w,\n/static/4d063d7c53c3a13220718dbda8e2142d/f058b/mounted_front.png 630w,\n/static/4d063d7c53c3a13220718dbda8e2142d/40601/mounted_front.png 945w,\n/static/4d063d7c53c3a13220718dbda8e2142d/78612/mounted_front.png 1260w,\n/static/4d063d7c53c3a13220718dbda8e2142d/493ac/mounted_front.png 4032w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>From the front, clean lines and functional design. Nothing fancy, but well-executed. It’s been hanging in the same spot for years now, quietly doing its job.</p>\n<p>Quick projects like this are great palette cleansers between bigger builds. A couple hours from idea to finished product, and something useful at the end. Not everything needs to be a masterpiece - sometimes you just need a paper towel holder.</p>","frontmatter":{"title":"Paper Towel Holder","date":"April 01, 2018","description":null}},"previous":{"fields":{"slug":"/008-shop-upgrade-part-2/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Shop Upgrade Part 2 - Shiplap and Lighting"}},"next":{"fields":{"slug":"/010-pop-tops-mark-2/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Pop Tops Mark 2"}}},"pageContext":{"id":"2b9c7766-6857-585f-a6a0-0497d1962e87","previousPostId":"4cb38f95-7bea-5707-b068-5fa057df7909","nextPostId":"3a0ff103-6336-52c6-9ca8-ce52cb49a393"}},"staticQueryHashes":["2841359383"],"slicesMap":{}}